    "Barcode found: %@. Its code is filled in." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement after a barcode read from a photo or a file fills in the new card form. The argument is its format, as in “Barcode found: EAN-13”. The format's name is already translated and may contain the word code, as QR Code and Code 128 do, so do not add one."
    },
