    "Cancel" : {
      "comment" : "Button in the delete-all dialog that keeps the cards.\nButton in the delete-card dialog that keeps the card.\nCloses the Add Location sheet without adding a place.\nCloses the import sheet without importing.\nCloses the list of barcodes found in a photo or a file without filling in the card form.\nCloses the sheet for a card someone shared without adding the card.",
